ine id="07-tracking_edge6" x1="292" y1="1792" x2="1308" y2="1792" data-start="07-tracking_anchor6a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor6b" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,5"/><line id="07-tracking_edge7" x1="2844" y1="1984" x2="2340" y2="1984" data-start="07-tracking_anchor7a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor7b" data-start-side="left" data-end-side="right" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="07-tracking_edge8" x1="2332" y1="2176" x2="1828" y2="2176" data-start="07-tracking_anchor8a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor8b" data-start-side="left" data-end-side="right" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><line id="07-tracking_edge9" x1="1828" y1="2368" x2="2332" y2="2368" data-start="07-tracking_anchor9a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor9b" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,5"/><line id="07-tracking_edge10" x1="2340" y1="2560" x2="2844" y2="2560" data-start="07-tracking_anchor10a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor10b" data-start-side="right" data-end-side="left" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5,5"/><line id="07-tracking_edge11" x1="2844" y1="2752" x2="2340" y2="2752" data-start="07-tracking_anchor11a" data-end="07-tracking_anchor11b" data-start-side="left" data-end-side="right" data-shape="straight" data-arrow="end" stroke="#313131" stroke-width="2"/><textArea id="07-tracking_text0" x="308" y="488" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">1. Signed shipment event</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text1" x="820" y="680" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">2. Verify signature; store unique event</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text2" x="308" y="872" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">3. Acknowledge durable receipt</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text3" x="1332" y="1064" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">4. Claim inbox event; deduplicate</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text4" x="1332" y="1256" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">5. Normalize status; persist timeline + outbox</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text5" x="308" y="1448" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">6. Scheduled polling for missing/stale events</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text6" x="308" y="1640" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">7. Current provider shipment state</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text7" x="2356" y="1832" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">8. GET own order tracking; access token</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text8" x="1844" y="2024" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">9. Check ownership; read each shipment</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text9" x="1844" y="2216" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">10. Timeline, ETA, last update, exceptions</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text10" x="2356" y="2408" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">11. Tracking view; contact-support link</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text11" x="2356" y="2600" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">12. Refresh with ETag; back off offline</textArea><textArea id="07-tracking_text12" x="64" y="3520" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">No customer cancellation action. Split shipments remain separate; stale data is labeled. Do not regress shipment state for late events or expose another customer&apos;s order by tracking ID.</textArea></g></svg>